    "/* ---- Restored: Phase 18a/18b-era UI that predates the Task 8 design demo ---- */",
    "/* (view switcher, empty state, field label/value pairs, memo edit controls: */",
    "/* colors ported from the pre-Task-8 rules to the new --navy/--kin design tokens) */",
